# Singletons must be declared here, not only marked `pragma Singleton`.
# Without this file an `import "../theme"` from a subdirectory resolves to
# nothing and every token silently reads as undefined — QML renders that as
# black, so the failure looks like a design decision rather than a bug.
#
# The colour singleton is called Scheme, NOT Palette: QtQuick ships its own
# `Palette` type, which silently shadows ours and turns the entire desktop
# black. Never name a singleton after a Qt built-in.
singleton Scheme 1.0 Scheme.qml
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton FromImage 1.0 FromImage.qml
